[[:db/add "146a6848-4c14-54f4-896c-6353d2be975f" :answer/id #uuid "146a6848-4c14-54f4-896c-6353d2be975f"] [:db/add "146a6848-4c14-54f4-896c-6353d2be975f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "146a6848-4c14-54f4-896c-6353d2be975f" :answer/value "{y}^{4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡5x}"] [:db/ensure "146a6848-4c14-54f4-896c-6353d2be975f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "87cff2c1-2f5f-5115-a5f6-9a13401b251c" :answer/id #uuid "87cff2c1-2f5f-5115-a5f6-9a13401b251c"] [:db/add "87cff2c1-2f5f-5115-a5f6-9a13401b251c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "87cff2c1-2f5f-5115-a5f6-9a13401b251c" :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡5x}{{y}^{4}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1"] [:db/ensure "87cff2c1-2f5f-5115-a5f6-9a13401b251c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "4541b76c-c7b3-5127-b1e4-c58c64357eda" :answer/id #uuid "4541b76c-c7b3-5127-b1e4-c58c64357eda"] [:db/add "4541b76c-c7b3-5127-b1e4-c58c64357eda" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4541b76c-c7b3-5127-b1e4-c58c64357eda" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{y}^{4}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡5x"] [:db/ensure "4541b76c-c7b3-5127-b1e4-c58c64357eda" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b147539d-7371-5abc-b988-808f480064ab" :answer/id #uuid "b147539d-7371-5abc-b988-808f480064ab"] [:db/add "b147539d-7371-5abc-b988-808f480064ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b147539d-7371-5abc-b988-808f480064ab" :answer/value "\\operatorname{csc}⁡5x\\text{ }\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={y}^{4}"] [:db/ensure "b147539d-7371-5abc-b988-808f480064ab" :answer/validate] [:db/add "1dddfec0-8c43-5725-82f4-bf621478bf25" :answer/id #uuid "1dddfec0-8c43-5725-82f4-bf621478bf25"] [:db/add "1dddfec0-8c43-5725-82f4-bf621478bf25" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "1dddfec0-8c43-5725-82f4-bf621478bf25" :answer/value "\\operatorname{sin}⁡5x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={y}^{4}"] [:db/ensure "1dddfec0-8c43-5725-82f4-bf621478bf25" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/id #uuid "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84"] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/choices "146a6848-4c14-54f4-896c-6353d2be975f"] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/choices "87cff2c1-2f5f-5115-a5f6-9a13401b251c"] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/choices "4541b76c-c7b3-5127-b1e4-c58c64357eda"] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/choices "b147539d-7371-5abc-b988-808f480064ab"] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/choices "1dddfec0-8c43-5725-82f4-bf621478bf25"] [:db/add "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/correct "4541b76c-c7b3-5127-b1e4-c58c64357eda"] [:db/ensure "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df" :question/id #uuid "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df"] [:db/add "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={y}^{4}\\operatorname{sin}⁡5x\n$$\n\nWork on a domain where all displayed expressions are defined."] [:db/add "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df" :question/worked-solution "A differential equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differential equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡5x\\cdot {y}^{4}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{{y}^{4}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\operatorname{sin}⁡5x\n$$"] [:db/add "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df" :question/answer-fields "d38167bd-5604-5321-bf6c-b37cfdaa0c84"] [:db/ensure "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068842 :knowledge-point/questions "2b2de01b-9c24-57b5-ab7b-9a58a2d499df"] [:db/add "f206f8f0-1ba0-5b8b-bf32-f65a750f7264" :answer/id #uuid "f206f8f0-1ba0-5b8b-bf32-f65a750f7264"] [:db/add "f206f8f0-1ba0-5b8b-bf32-f65a750f7264" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f206f8f0-1ba0-5b8b-bf32-f65a750f7264" :answer/value "(x+2)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=x{y}^{3}"] [:db/ensure "f206f8f0-1ba0-5b8b-bf32-f65a750f7264" :answer/validate] [:db/add "d1482077-a0ab-5428-be6c-a6547a3e99ec" :answer/id #uuid "d1482077-a0ab-5428-be6c-a6547a3e99ec"] [:db/add "d1482077-a0ab-5428-be6c-a6547a3e99ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d1482077-a0ab-5428-be6c-a6547a3e99ec" :answer/value "{y}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{x+2}"] [:db/ensure "d1482077-a0ab-5428-be6c-a6547a3e99ec" :answer/validate] [:db/add "927d7c9c-7c88-56a4-bb96-9228be003e59" :answer/id #uuid "927d7c9c-7c88-56a4-bb96-9228be003e59"] [:db/add "927d7c9c-7c88-56a4-bb96-9228be003e59" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "927d7c9c-7c88-56a4-bb96-9228be003e59" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{x+2}"] [:db/ensure "927d7c9c-7c88-56a4-bb96-9228be003e59" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b7637471-17ff-5dac-a428-f7ea2286d7ab" :answer/id #uuid "b7637471-17ff-5dac-a428-f7ea2286d7ab"] [:db/add "b7637471-17ff-5dac-a428-f7ea2286d7ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b7637471-17ff-5dac-a428-f7ea2286d7ab" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{y}^{3}}{x+2}"] [:db/ensure "b7637471-17ff-5dac-a428-f7ea2286d7ab" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7b4f35d9-488b-510e-ae8b-c7bdec3e214e" 