s written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differential equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=(\\frac{x}{x+2})\\cdot {y}^{3}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{{y}^{3}}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{x+2}\n$$"] [:db/add "f53921ad-14e5-53c4-8aac-ee2f62ff5e14" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f53921ad-14e5-53c4-8aac-ee2f62ff5e14" :question/answer-fields "ae41734e-ef85-5b0c-a7c5-8ec5da72ddb3"] [:db/ensure "f53921ad-14e5-53c4-8aac-ee2f62ff5e14" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068842 :knowledge-point/questions "f53921ad-14e5-53c4-8aac-ee2f62ff5e14"] [:db/add "ec8f5c3a-726a-570d-9b70-c29708c1834b" :answer/id #uuid "ec8f5c3a-726a-570d-9b70-c29708c1834b"] [:db/add "ec8f5c3a-726a-570d-9b70-c29708c1834b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ec8f5c3a-726a-570d-9b70-c29708c1834b" :answer/value "y\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={4}^{4x}"] [:db/ensure "ec8f5c3a-726a-570d-9b70-c29708c1834b" :answer/validate] [:db/add "0901fe67-23ab-5ba3-b592-df465e6d58e6" :answer/id #uuid "0901fe67-23ab-5ba3-b592-df465e6d58e6"] [:db/add "0901fe67-23ab-5ba3-b592-df465e6d58e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "0901fe67-23ab-5ba3-b592-df465e6d58e6" :answer/value "{y}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={4}^{4x}"] [:db/ensure "0901fe67-23ab-5ba3-b592-df465e6d58e6" :answer/validate] [:db/add "afc8ebe3-8b39-563f-bdd1-f323a95cd07c" :answer/id #uuid "afc8ebe3-8b39-563f-bdd1-f323a95cd07c"] [:db/add "afc8ebe3-8b39-563f-bdd1-f323a95cd07c" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "afc8ebe3-8b39-563f-bdd1-f323a95cd07c" :answer/value "x\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={4}^{4x}"] [:db/ensure "afc8ebe3-8b39-563f-bdd1-f323a95cd07c" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ad252bce-54c5-5a83-8785-c5467955fd75" :answer/id #uuid "ad252bce-54c5-5a83-8785-c5467955fd75"] [:db/add "ad252bce-54c5-5a83-8785-c