b/add "3d2da0ff-f35d-57a2-b6bc-f73ea32ee54e" :question/worked-solution "A differential equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differential equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={4}^{4x}\\cdot \\frac{1}{{y}^{4}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n{y}^{4}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={4}^{4x}\n$$"] [:db/add "3d2da0ff-f35d-57a2-b6bc-f73ea32ee54e" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "3d2da0ff-f35d-57a2-b6bc-f73ea32ee54e" :question/answer-fields "f2ba0e5c-3850-5567-9b1b-5e8d4197744e"] [:db/ensure "3d2da0ff-f35d-57a2-b6bc-f73ea32ee54e" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068842 :knowledge-point/questions "3d2da0ff-f35d-57a2-b6bc-f73ea32ee54e"] [:db/add "59cc5e7d-45cc-5682-9aeb-9c114937332e" :answer/id #uuid "59cc5e7d-45cc-5682-9aeb-9c114937332e"] [:db/add "59cc5e7d-45cc-5682-9aeb-9c114937332e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "59cc5e7d-45cc-5682-9aeb-9c114937332e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4x}"] [:db/ensure "59cc5e7d-45cc-5682-9aeb-9c114937332e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "da90372f-d502-52aa-84c2-46e0cfb2eb5f" :answer/id #uuid "da90372f-d502-52aa-84c2-46e0cfb2eb5f"] [:db/add "da90372f-d502-52aa-84c2-46e0cfb2eb5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "da90372f-d502-52aa-84c2-46e0cfb2eb5f" :answer/value "{e}^{-4x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=y"] [:db/ensure "da90372f-d502-52aa-84c2-46e0cfb2eb5f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "bb74df3e-88fa-5a64-8607-b7f384c999a0" :answer/id #uuid "bb74df3e-88fa-5a64-8607-b7f384c999a0"] [:db/add "bb74df3e-88fa-5a64-8607-b7f384c999a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "bb74df3e-88fa-5a64-8607-b7f384c999a0" :answer/value "y\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4x}"] [:db/ensure "bb74df3e-88fa-5a64-8607-b7f384c999a0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "44b2395c-9177-5c71-93ce-21b5d23bcaf2" :answer/id #uuid "44b2395c-9177-5c71-93ce-21b5d23bcaf2"] [:db/add "44b2395c-9177-5c71-93ce-21b5d23bcaf2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "44b2395c-9177-5c71-93ce-21b5d23bcaf2" :answer/value "{e}^{4x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=y"] [:db/ensure "44b2395c-9177-5c71-93ce-21b5d23bcaf2" :answer/validate] [:db/add "ad6a02c2-84cf-5126-98e5-1c572aca6d39" :answer/id #uuid "ad6a02c2-84cf-5126-98e5-1c572aca6d39"] [:db/add "ad6a02c2-84cf-5126-98e5-1c572aca6d39" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "ad6a02c2-84cf-5126-98e5-1c572aca6d39" :answer/value "\\frac{{e}^{-4x}}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=1"] [:db/ensure "ad6a02c2-84cf-5126-98e5-1c572aca6d39" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/id #uuid "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52"] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/key "selection"] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/choices "59cc5e7d-45cc-5682-9aeb-9c114937332e"] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/choices "da90372f-d502-52aa-84c2-46e0cfb2eb5f"] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/choices "bb74df3e-88fa-5a64-8607-b7f384c999a0"] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/choices "44b2395c-9177-5c71-93ce-21b5d23bcaf2"] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/choices "ad6a02c2-84cf-5126-98e5-1c572aca6d39"] [:db/add "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/correct "59cc5e7d-45cc-5682-9aeb-9c114937332e"] [:db/ensure "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4" :question/id #uuid "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4"] [:db/add "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4" :question/problem "Separate the variables in the following differential equation: \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=y{e}^{4x}\n$$\n\nWork on a domain where all displayed expressions are defined."] [:db/add "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4" :question/worked-solution "A differential equation is *separable* if it can be written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x)g(y).\n$$\n\nIf an equation is separable, we say that the variables are *separated* when it is written in the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{g(y)}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=h(x).\n$$\n\nNotice that our differential equation is separable since it can be written as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4x}\\cdot y.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we separate the variables as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{y}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}={e}^{4x}\n$$"] [:db/add "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4" :question/answer-fields "b891c151-dbc1-5e86-a54a-094aae5b0b52"] [:db/ensure "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186068842 :knowledge-point/questions "f7f03e26-82e0-5fd2-a240-4632479a76e4"] [:db/add "4a07cfb7-4cad-58e0-a4d0-e4f2d278150e" :answer/id #uuid "4a07cfb7-4cad-58e0-a4d0-e4f2d278150e"] [:db/add "4a07cfb7-4cad-58e0-a4d0-e4f2d278150e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "4a07cfb7-4cad-58e0-a4d0-e4f2d278150e" :answer/value "\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{{y}^{3}}{x+1}"] [:db/ensure "4a07cfb7-4cad-58e0-a4d0-e4f2d278150e" :answer/validate] [:db/add "9868d3e4-f7cb-57e8-9301-8d3315ab32af" :answer/id #uuid "9868d3e4-f7cb-57e8-9301-8d3315ab32af"] [:db/add "9868d3e4-f7cb-57e8-9301-8d3315ab32af" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9868d3e4-f7cb-57e8-9301-8d3315ab32af" :answer/value "{y}^{3}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{x}{x+1}"] [:db/ensure "9868d3e4-f7cb-57e8-9301-8d